ent-NinjaActionToggleJetpack = toggle built-in jetpack
    .desc = Toggles the jetpack built into the suit for extra mobility in space.
ent-ActionNinjaAutoDust = auto-dust
    .desc = Toggles the suit self-destruct program. When enabled, the ninja body turns to dust on critical state or death and the equipment is destroyed so it cannot be recovered. Modes: off, dust on critical state, dust on death.
ent-ActionNinjaSelfAnalyze = health analyzer
    .desc = Instantly scans the suit wearer and shows their health state.
ent-ActionCycleNinjaVisor = cycle visor mode
    .desc = Switches the visor between flash protection, thermal vision and night vision.

ninja-auto-dust-off = Auto-dust disabled
ninja-auto-dust-crit = Auto-dust: body turns to dust on critical state
ninja-auto-dust-dead = Auto-dust: body turns to dust on death
ninja-suit-refill = The suit recycled the material and restored a charge of "{$action}".
